{
  "_readme": [
    "Maps a Groupon campaign + option onto the Pixel8 service it entitles.",
    "valuePence is the Groupon ORIGINAL VALUE for that option — it is what the",
    "voucher is worth as a discount here, and it matches the site price by design.",
    "dealPence is what the customer paid Groupon; it is recorded for reporting only",
    "and never affects what the voucher is worth.",
    "Options are matched on valuePence first, then on a case-insensitive substring",
    "of labelMatch against the option title in the import file.",
    "Keep this in step with the live campaigns — an unmapped deal id fails the",
    "import loudly rather than guessing."
